_b/cottage_b-play-overview.jpg`, four clusters around the start meadow at (1, 0), (-1, 0), (0, -1) and (-1, 1); the first three draw `house_cottage_b` in one cottage slot and (-1, 1) draws `house_longhouse`, from `caffeinate -d -u target/release/hex-world --scenario play --script docs/checkpoints/house_cottage_b/play.json --size 1600x1000 --seed 1 --fps off --tilt off --clock fixed`, which also takes a walk-mode eye-level shot in the (1, 0) yard (`cottage_b-walk-eye.jpg`). The older `docs/checkpoints/house_longhouse/play.jpg` and `play-overview.jpg` show the same four cells before `house_cottage_b` joined the row, each with one longhouse.
 
